# Absolute address of the share image (Open Graph). By default the copy on
# GitHub (pushed with main); to use your own site, set it to
# https://your.site/path/og-image.png (the build copies public/og-image.png there).
VITE_OG_IMAGE=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/warnotte/WaxVocoder/main/public/og-image.png
